The stylist, therefore, does not glimpse himself physically, but also deals, for example, with product pages in magazines (of specific topics, such as trends, bags, coats, etc.).
The stylist and designer Mario Kameník talked about.
But that's all left by Sunday.
The stylist must have a global vision.
The three specialist guests animated Saturday's conference with information about all kinds of bodies.
Stylist Honza Pokon, fashion designer Jakub Polanka and fashion photographer Ben Ren.
