And we did nothing but coated.
We couldn't knock the shoes with the scissors so we couldn't damage them by accident.
So you had to be very skilful.
Mario has given me a greed in praising my work unreservedly.
I really don't get those skills very good.
It's just a small part of everyone we've listened to throughout the weekend, in the second part of the course.
