Make unpleasant comments
"The worn underpants are left with dirty laundry".
"Would you want to wear those worn socks tomorrow".
"The wet rag doesn't get left on the floor".
"If you're making those diners to your partner more times a day, you'll know how you'll get it out of your boxes.
You don't want to say anything wrong, you just want to get it all in order.
"Maybe, if the men knew about this, the women wouldn't make so many comments.
Slanders and gossip
Some slanders also have slanders, gossip, but so are the offenses and the conspiracy against someone.
Women are focused on relationships, that's why they like to talk things together about the type who, where, with whom, how and why.
Maybe every one of us sometimes gets away with a harmless little gossip.
With your hand in your heart, this is typical of almost all women.
On the other hand, there are gossip women who don't control each other, those who love to gossip and they often despicate everyone and are dangerous to those around them, especially on a women's labor team.
