Must contributions for works
The works of a social nature provided for in programs such as Habitat, Rescue of Public Spaces and 3x1 for migrants are at risk of not being completed or have serious delays due to the lack of economic resources, said Miguel Ángel López Miranda.
The Director of Municipal Social Development indicated that although the work programmes have so far progressed, they are at risk because the State Government has not fulfilled the contributions that correspond to it, amounting to a resource of more than 11 million pesos in the three programmes.
He pointed out that in total the investment in these three programs it is almost 50 million pesos, of which the State corresponds to 25 per cent and that until now only the Federation and the Municipality have provided resources for the works, so the possible delay in the completion of these becomes effective.
